{"id":"d0cea8c71c1f6767","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-knot-homology.md","title":"Knot Homology","display":"df-knot-homology — Knot Homology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-knot-homology","aliases":["58-df-knot-homology","Knot Homology"],"display":"df-knot-homology — Knot Homology","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]","[[58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-knot-homology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-knot-homology</span><span>Knot Homology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-knot-homology — Knot Homology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9f6d19a1e737076\" href=\"?note=d9f6d19a1e737076\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-homology.md\">../batch08/58-df-homology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccaaf599ec318a33\" href=\"?note=ccaaf599ec318a33\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-knot.md\">../batch05/58-df-knot.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eb086d7ad41bcaef\" href=\"?note=eb086d7ad41bcaef\" title=\"58-df-knot-resolution-data.md\">58-df-knot-resolution-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5faf0467ca9c794e\" href=\"?note=5faf0467ca9c794e\" title=\"58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md\">58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,D,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\">\\(k,D,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\">\\(\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,k)\">\\(\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,k)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cr}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cr}(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_\\pm(D)\">\\(n_\\pm(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_D\">\\(\\mathsf S_D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_D\">\\(c_D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon_D\">\\(\\epsilon_D\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"eb086d7ad41bcaef\" href=\"?note=eb086d7ad41bcaef\" title=\"58-df-knot-resolution-data.md\">58-df-knot-resolution-data.md</a>；有限标记基 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}\">\\(\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}\\)</span>、矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{D,R,0_R}\">\\(K_{D,R,0_R}\\)</span> 与边映射使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5faf0467ca9c794e\" href=\"?note=5faf0467ca9c794e\" title=\"58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md\">58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_R=R[X]/(X^2)\">\\(A_R=R[X]/(X^2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1=[1]\">\\(1=[1]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=[X]\">\\(X=[X]\\)</span>。张量积采用以消解圈为指标的自由模模型：基标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 在每个圈上选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>；其具体坐标载体见下式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^B\">\\(R^B\\)</span> 的线性结构逐点给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf e_u(v)=1_R\">\\(\\mathsf e_u(v)=1_R\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\">\\(u=v\\)</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_R\">\\(0_R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_B\">\\(0_B\\)</span> 是零函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A_R\\otimes_R A_R\\to A_R\">\\(m:A_R\\otimes_R A_R\\to A_R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta:A_R\\to A_R\\otimes_R A_R\">\\(\\Delta:A_R\\to A_R\\otimes_R A_R\\)</span> 由下式在所有系数上的公式确定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg\">\\(\\deg\\)</span> 在非零系数环时仅用于所列两个齐次生成元。零环的分次由形式标记基给出，不对其唯一零向量同时赋两个次数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,q\">\\(t,q\\)</span> 为形式 Laurent 变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\">\\(C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{Kh}\">\\(d_{Kh}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{Kh}^{i,j}\">\\(d_{Kh}^{i,j}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Kh^{i,j}(D;R)\">\\(Kh^{i,j}(D;R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Poin}_{Kh(D;R)}\">\\(\\operatorname{Poin}_{Kh(D;R)}\\)</span> 保留原名称；下式给出它们的具体模型。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}frobenius}\\vdash\\quad\n&amp;\\forall r\\in R^4\\quad\nm\\bigl(r(0)(1\\otimes1)+r(1)(1\\otimes X)+r(2)(X\\otimes1)+r(3)(X\\otimes X)\\bigr)\n=r(0)1+(r(1)+r(2))X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall r\\in R^2\\quad\n\\Delta(r(0)1+r(1)X)=r(0)(1\\otimes X+X\\otimes1)+r(1)(X\\otimes X),\\\\\n&amp;0_R\\ne1_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (\\deg(1)=1\\land\\deg(X)=-1).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}frobenius}\\vdash\\quad\n&amp;\\forall r\\in R^4\\quad\nm\\bigl(r(0)(1\\otimes1)+r(1)(1\\otimes X)+r(2)(X\\otimes1)+r(3)(X\\otimes X)\\bigr)\n=r(0)1+(r(1)+r(2))X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall r\\in R^2\\quad\n\\Delta(r(0)1+r(1)X)=r(0)(1\\otimes X+X\\otimes1)+r(1)(X\\otimes X),\\\\\n&amp;0_R\\ne1_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (\\deg(1)=1\\land\\deg(X)=-1).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\\quad\nC_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;:=R^{\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_{D,R}(s)&amp;:=R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)},\\\\\n\\bigotimes_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}e_{\\ell(A)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf e_{\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle},\n\\qquad e_0:=1,\\quad e_1:=X,\\\\\nC_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;\\cong\n\\bigoplus_{\\substack{s\\in\\mathsf S_D\\\\|s|-n_-(D)=i}}\n\\left(\\bigotimes_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}A_R\\right)_{j-|s|-n_+(D)+2n_-(D)}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\\quad\nC_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;:=R^{\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_{D,R}(s)&amp;:=R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)},\\\\\n\\bigotimes_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}e_{\\ell(A)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf e_{\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle},\n\\qquad e_0:=1,\\quad e_1:=X,\\\\\nC_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;\\cong\n\\bigoplus_{\\substack{s\\in\\mathsf S_D\\\\|s|-n_-(D)=i}}\n\\left(\\bigotimes_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}A_R\\right)_{j-|s|-n_+(D)+2n_-(D)}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}differential}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mu_e&amp;:=\\mu^{0_R}_{D,R,e},\\qquad d_{Kh}:=\\partial^{0_R}_{D,R},\\\\\nd_{Kh}^{i,j}:C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;\\longrightarrow C_{Kh}^{i+1,j}(D;R),\\\\\n(d_{Kh}^{i,j}v)(w)&amp;:=\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}}K_{D,R,0_R}(w,u)\\cdot v(u),\\\\\n\\forall v\\in C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\quad d_{Kh}^{i+1,j}(d_{Kh}^{i,j}v)&amp;=0_{\\mathcal E_D^{i+2,j}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}differential}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mu_e&amp;:=\\mu^{0_R}_{D,R,e},\\qquad d_{Kh}:=\\partial^{0_R}_{D,R},\\\\\nd_{Kh}^{i,j}:C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;\\longrightarrow C_{Kh}^{i+1,j}(D;R),\\\\\n(d_{Kh}^{i,j}v)(w)&amp;:=\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}}K_{D,R,0_R}(w,u)\\cdot v(u),\\\\\n\\forall v\\in C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\quad d_{Kh}^{i+1,j}(d_{Kh}^{i,j}v)&amp;=0_{\\mathcal E_D^{i+2,j}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nZ_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;:=\\{v\\in C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R):d_{Kh}^{i,j}v=0_{\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j}}\\},\\\\\nB_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;:=\\{d_{Kh}^{i-1,j}v:v\\in C_{Kh}^{i-1,j}(D;R)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}group}\\vdash\\quad\nKh^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;:=\\{\\{z+b:b\\in B_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\}:z\\in Z_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\},\\\\\n[z]+[w]&amp;:=[z+w],\\qquad r[z]:=[rz]\\quad(r\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nZ_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;:=\\{v\\in C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R):d_{Kh}^{i,j}v=0_{\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j}}\\},\\\\\nB_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;:=\\{d_{Kh}^{i-1,j}v:v\\in C_{Kh}^{i-1,j}(D;R)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}group}\\vdash\\quad\nKh^{i,j}(D;R)&amp;:=\\{\\{z+b:b\\in B_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\}:z\\in Z_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\},\\\\\n[z]+[w]&amp;:=[z+w],\\qquad r[z]:=[rz]\\quad(r\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA_D^{i,j}&amp;:=K_{D,R,0_R}\\upharpoonright(\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j}\\times\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\Longrightarrow\\quad r_D^{i,j}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}(A_D^{i,j};\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j},\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}poincare}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n\\operatorname{Poin}_{Kh(D;R)}(t,q)&amp;:=\n\\sum_{(i,j)\\in\\{(\\iota_D(u),q_D(u)):u\\in\\mathcal E_D\\}}\n\\bigl(|\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}|-r_D^{i,j}-r_D^{i-1,j}\\bigr)t^iq^j.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA_D^{i,j}&amp;:=K_{D,R,0_R}\\upharpoonright(\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j}\\times\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\Longrightarrow\\quad r_D^{i,j}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}(A_D^{i,j};\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j},\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}poincare}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n\\operatorname{Poin}_{Kh(D;R)}(t,q)&amp;:=\n\\sum_{(i,j)\\in\\{(\\iota_D(u),q_D(u)):u\\in\\mathcal E_D\\}}\n\\bigl(|\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}|-r_D^{i,j}-r_D^{i-1,j}\\bigr)t^iq^j.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>仍定义所选图的归一化 Khovanov 复形及上同调；自由模坐标只是原张量积的显式实现，不改其双分次或 Frobenius 运算。</li>\n<li>圈数、交叉符号、鞍点与立方体符号已由内部依赖实际构造，删除 Remark 后仍能重建所有矩阵。</li>\n<li>Reidemeister 不变性是该构造的定理，不被当作未解释的“图同调数据”前提。域情形的 Poincaré 系数使用核像维数公式，底域仍是同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Khovanov, A Categorification of the Jones Polynomial</li>\n<li>Bar-Natan, On Khovanov's Categorification of the Jones Polynomial</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-homology.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9f6d19a1e737076","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-homology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-knot.md","status":"resolved","id":"ccaaf599ec318a33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-knot.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-knot-resolution-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"eb086d7ad41bcaef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"5faf0467ca9c794e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-knot-resolution-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"eb086d7ad41bcaef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i,j\\in\\mathbb Z$。$\\operatorname{Cr}(D)$、$n_\\pm(D)$、$\\mathsf S_D$、$c_D$、$\\epsilon_D$ 使用 [[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]；有限标记基 $\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}$、矩阵 $K_{D,R,0_R}$ 与边映射使用 [[58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"5faf0467ca9c794e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i,j\\in\\mathbb Z$。$\\operatorname{Cr}(D)$、$n_\\pm(D)$、$\\mathsf S_D$、$c_D$、$\\epsilon_D$ 使用 [[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]；有限标记基 $\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}$、矩阵 $K_{D,R,0_R}$ 与边映射使用 [[58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Field}$ 取 [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,D,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Knot}_S(k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,k)","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cr}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"n_\\pm(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_D","display":false},{"tex":"c_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}","display":false},{"tex":"K_{D,R,0_R}","display":false},{"tex":"A_R=R[X]/(X^2)","display":false},{"tex":"1=[1]","display":false},{"tex":"X=[X]","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"R^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf e_u(v)=1_R","display":false},{"tex":"u=v","display":false},{"tex":"0_R","display":false},{"tex":"0_B","display":false},{"tex":"m:A_R\\otimes_R A_R\\to A_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta:A_R\\to A_R\\otimes_R A_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg","display":false},{"tex":"t,q","display":false},{"tex":"C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)","display":false},{"tex":"d_{Kh}","display":false},{"tex":"d_{Kh}^{i,j}","display":false},{"tex":"Kh^{i,j}(D;R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Poin}_{Kh(D;R)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}frobenius}\\vdash\\quad\n&\\forall r\\in R^4\\quad\nm\\bigl(r(0)(1\\otimes1)+r(1)(1\\otimes X)+r(2)(X\\otimes1)+r(3)(X\\otimes X)\\bigr)\n=r(0)1+(r(1)+r(2))X,\\\\\n&\\forall r\\in R^2\\quad\n\\Delta(r(0)1+r(1)X)=r(0)(1\\otimes X+X\\otimes1)+r(1)(X\\otimes X),\\\\\n&0_R\\ne1_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (\\deg(1)=1\\land\\deg(X)=-1).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\\quad\nC_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&:=R^{\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}},\\\\\n\\mathcal A_{D,R}(s)&:=R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)},\\\\\n\\bigotimes_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}e_{\\ell(A)}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf e_{\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle},\n\\qquad e_0:=1,\\quad e_1:=X,\\\\\nC_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&\\cong\n\\bigoplus_{\\substack{s\\in\\mathsf S_D\\\\|s|-n_-(D)=i}}\n\\left(\\bigotimes_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}A_R\\right)_{j-|s|-n_+(D)+2n_-(D)}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}differential}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mu_e&:=\\mu^{0_R}_{D,R,e},\\qquad d_{Kh}:=\\partial^{0_R}_{D,R},\\\\\nd_{Kh}^{i,j}:C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&\\longrightarrow C_{Kh}^{i+1,j}(D;R),\\\\\n(d_{Kh}^{i,j}v)(w)&:=\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}}K_{D,R,0_R}(w,u)\\cdot v(u),\\\\\n\\forall v\\in C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\quad d_{Kh}^{i+1,j}(d_{Kh}^{i,j}v)&=0_{\\mathcal E_D^{i+2,j}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nZ_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&:=\\{v\\in C_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R):d_{Kh}^{i,j}v=0_{\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j}}\\},\\\\\nB_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)&:=\\{d_{Kh}^{i-1,j}v:v\\in C_{Kh}^{i-1,j}(D;R)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}group}\\vdash\\quad\nKh^{i,j}(D;R)&:=\\{\\{z+b:b\\in B_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\}:z\\in Z_{Kh}^{i,j}(D;R)\\},\\\\\n[z]+[w]&:=[z+w],\\qquad r[z]:=[rz]\\quad(r\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nA_D^{i,j}&:=K_{D,R,0_R}\\upharpoonright(\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j}\\times\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\Longrightarrow\\quad r_D^{i,j}&:=\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}(A_D^{i,j};\\mathcal E_D^{i+1,j},\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}knot\\text{-}homology\\text{-}poincare}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)&\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n\\operatorname{Poin}_{Kh(D;R)}(t,q)&:=\n\\sum_{(i,j)\\in\\{(\\iota_D(u),q_D(u)):u\\in\\mathcal E_D\\}}\n\\bigl(|\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}|-r_D^{i,j}-r_D^{i-1,j}\\bigr)t^iq^j.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":4605,"backlinks":[{"id":"6ae44e6a67df968f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-737","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-knot-homology.md|58-df-knot-homology]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["d9f6d19a1e737076","ccaaf599ec318a33","1c30d21ea7b443f6","1eb4a89b005d9cda","eb086d7ad41bcaef","5faf0467ca9c794e"]}